_627":628},{"_32":38,"_39":615},[616,617],-77.68105,43.08324,475,129,"The Market at Global Village","Convenience Store","A destination for groceries, produce, toiletries, and beverages. The Market at Global Village has an array of international ingredients, seasonings, snacks, and candy.  \r\n<br><br>\r\nOrder online at <a href=\"https://ondemand.rit.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">ondemand.rit.edu</a>\r\n","(585) 475-3454","https://www.rit.edu/dining/location/market-global-village","<a href=\"https://www.rit.edu/fa/diningservices/hours-and-locations\" target=\"_blank\">All Dining Hours</a>",[629],"clic","29",{"_70":620,"_630":631,"_72":632,"_45":619,"_74":618},"filename","MarketatGV.jpg","https://maps.rit.edu/pictures/TheMarketAtGV_16x9.jpg",{"_43":638,"_45":639,"_47":640,"_49":621,"_235":641,"_51":642,"_53":84,"_55":85,"_57":58,"_61":625,"_63":64,"_65":638,"_67":643,"_627":644},{"_32":38,"_39":635},[636,637],-77.6676,43.084904,467,127,"The Corner Store","The Corner Store is a grocery store with fresh produce, microwavable entrées, dairy products, snacks, toiletries, school supplies, grab-and-go sandwiches, ice cream, and beverages.\r\n<br><br>\r\nOrder online at <a href=\"https://ondemand.rit.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">ondemand.rit.edu</a>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","https://www.rit.edu/dining/location/corner-store",[645],"27",{"_70":640,"_630":646,"_72":647,"_45":639,"_74":638},"CornerStore.jpg","https://maps.rit.edu/pictures/CornerStore_16X9.jpg",259,"Retail","shopping_basket",64,{"_43":961,"_47":962,"_32":126,"_127":-5,"_128":-5,"_129":963,"_130":131,"_132":133},[654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661],{"_32":33,"_34":937,"_36":938},{"_32":33,"_34":848,"_36":849},{"_32":33,"_34":805,"_36":806},{"_32":33,"_34":790,"_36":791},{"_32":33,"_34":768,"_36":769},{"_32":33,"_34":730,"_36":731},{"_32":33,"_34":682,"_36":683},{"_32":33,"_34":662,"_36":663},{"_43":667,"_45":668,"_47":669,"_49":670,"_235":671,"_534":672,"_51":673,"_55":674,"_61":675,"_676":677,"_63":64,"_65":667,"_67":678},{"_32":38,"_39":664},[665,666],-77.69364,43.064095,4859,1664,"Osher Lifelong Learning Institute (OLLI)","Located south of campus, off East River Rd.","<strong>50 Fairwood Dr., Suite 100</br>Rochester, NY 14623</strong></br></br> The Osher Lifelong Learning Institute (OLLI) is a community of vibrant adult/senior learners at Rochester Institute of Technology (RIT) in Rochester, NY. We offer non-credit courses in the arts, technology, languages, history, science, literature, and more – all without the pressure of exams or grades! In a relaxed and informal atmosphere, our students (referred to as \"members\") share knowledge, spark ideas, inspire new thinking, and forge friendships. You do NOT have to be affiliated with RIT or any other university to participate in the OLLI program.\n<br><br>\nWe are part of the national OLLI Network, a dynamic consortium of more than 120 lifelong learning institutes dedicated to serving adults aged 50 and better. Funded in part by The Bernard Osher Foundation, each independent Institute is affiliated with a college or university, offering intellectually stimulating, non-credit courses and learning opportunities tailored to meet the diverse interests and needs of their local communities. Since the establishment of the first Institute in 2001, the network has expanded to all 50 states and the District of Columbia, serving more than 300 towns and cities across the nation. Courses, study groups, social events, and educational travel opportunities foster a culture of joy in learning and personal fulfillment without tests or grades.","(585) 292-8989","https://www.rit.edu/olli","155","Monday - Friday 8:30am - 4:30pm","address","50 FAIRWOOD DRIVE #100 ROCHESTER, NY 14623",[679],{"_70":680,"_72":681,"_45":668,"_74":667},"Osher Lifelong Learning Institute at RIT","https://maps.rit.edu/pictures/155_olli.jpg",{"_43":721,"_45":722,"_47":723,"_49":724,"_53":725,"_55":726,"_676":727,"_63":64,"_65":728,"_67":729},{"_32":684,"_39":685},"Polygon",[686],[687,688,